# Acorn Atom+ V191 repository-wide Git exclusions
# Keep all files locally; only authorised ROMs may be committed.

# Never commit downloaded ZIP archives or generated ROM output.
*.zip
**/data_ready/
**/_romscan_work/
**/ROM_REPORT.txt
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Roms/: default deny all files, then allow the preparation scripts
# and the three ROM images with redistribution permission.
/Roms/**
!/Roms/
!/Roms/*.py
!/Roms/ATMMC3E.rom
!/Roms/ASBK-I_v1.03.rom
!/Roms/ASBK-S_v24.bin

# Firmware data directories: default deny all files, including
# extensionless ROMs and duplicate names such as ATBASIC3 (3).
# Allow only the same three authorised ROM images.
**/data/**
!**/data/
!**/data/ATMMC3E.rom
!**/data/ASBK-I_v1.03.rom
!**/data/ASBK-S_v24.bin

# The rules above intentionally exclude all other files in firmware
# data/ directories. If a firmware data/ directory contains non-ROM
# assets that need publishing, review and allow them explicitly.
